    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess that makes sense. i'm just a bit nervous about the whole \"middleman\" thing. it feels like there's a lot of risk involved with having these big chunks of money just waiting in a vault or something until the last second. is there anything special about how they store it or how they guard it to make sure nothing goes wrong?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
