      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Funds held in escrow are not just kept in a general \"vault\"; they are typically held in special, insured escrow or trust accounts. These accounts are separate from the escrow company's operating funds, providing an extra layer of security and segregation. The process itself is heavily documented, with all transactions tracked by the escrow agent to minimize the chance of any misappropriation or error.",
